,"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T20:32:11-07:00","id":1221054,"title":"","content":"Mother touch yes... eves touch though just requirers a check<br /> <br /> <br /> but cant heal aggravated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T16:27:16-07:00","id":1221873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1217700-recent-calls-for-gun-control-hows-it-effect-wod?p=1217876#post1217876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not really. The US isn't going to make it illegal for &quot;officially authorized&quot; types to have guns. What's far more likely to happen is it takes away the option for say a kinfolk to get a gun to help deal with Fomori. Pentex will have its first teams all legally able to have guns. And of course spree shootings will still keep happening because there are explicit supernatural beings who are making it happen.</div> </div> </div> </div>Those are good points, but Garou still might be okay with their kinfolk having less access to guns if other human mortals also had less. Any tribe with lots of wolf kin, such as the Red Talons, would also probably like to see fewer guns available for Farmer Joe Sixpack to buy. It might be a tribal or local thing, but I suspect many in the Garou Nation would be proud and confident enough to believe their kinfolk better off under direct Garou protection from enemies like Pentex and leeches than left to defend themselves against hostile monsters with only firearms. The benefit of reducing the threat of everyday humans against their kinfolk, especially lupine kinfolk, might really seem worth it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13713,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","user":"Wilson","date":". 05-24-2018, 07:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T16:51:00-07:00","id":1221879,"title":"","content":"Hmmmn would this kind of legislation also open a potential pandora's box for first teams if theirs one screw up that hits the airwaves?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T18:41:39-07:00","id":1222143,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wilson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1217700-recent-calls-for-gun-control-hows-it-effect-wod?p=1221873#post1221873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Those are good points, but Garou still might be okay with their kinfolk having less access to guns if other human mortals also had less. Any tribe with lots of wolf kin, such as the Red Talons, would also probably like to see fewer guns available for Farmer Joe Sixpack to buy. It might be a tribal or local thing, but I suspect many in the Garou Nation would be proud and confident enough to believe their kinfolk better off under direct Garou protection from enemies like Pentex and leeches than left to defend themselves against hostile monsters with only firearms. The benefit of reducing the threat of everyday humans against their kinfolk, especially lupine kinfolk, might really seem worth it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Farmer Joe Sixpack is really unlikely to ever not have a gun. Farmers in Europe.. have guns. Hunters have guns in Japan. If laws against Killing wolves aren't cutting it laws against guns aren't going to do a damn thing. Many Garou will be proud of themselves and claim that kinfolk don't need guns but when none of those laws are slowing down Pentex because &quot;they are liscened&quot; well...<br /> <br /> and what's not liscenced was already illegal ops they were getting away with. I mean first teams aren't exactly legal.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1217700-recent-calls-for-gun-control-hows-it-effect-wod?p=1221879#post1221879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmmn would this kind of legislation also open a potential pandora's box for first teams if theirs one screw up that hits the airwaves?</div> </div> </div> </div>It really depends. I mean first teams are already pretty solidly on the Grey to illegal side of things. You're probably not going to get a good recording of them doing something that's not veil breaking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-26T00:54:13-07:00","id":1222180,"title":"","content":"Honestly, Im not sure anything would really change (in the US), except it might tilt more towards the anti-gun legislation. I image in the WoD there are more folks staying indoors after dark and part of echo chambers, and more politicians and officials willing to promise whatever to get or stay in office, (on both sides), but little actual change of the status quo.<br /> <br /> On the other side, because the unexplained is a real thing, wven if not publically known/accepted, and the world is darker, more people will probably own guns and weapons, legally or not, and probably have a bit more actual training, at least in the basics of use.<br /> <br /> There are likewise more dark alleys, thugs mugging, assaults, gangs, etc...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://t0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTAO8runv-CR5dodCXgw_8wdJype5yunYCODWdZiBAwUP5WFVv8\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/003/593/392/92a29c2836b988505781770a32720148_original.png?v=1428699067&amp;w=700&amp;h=&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=69ffdde357a0cdd88ee89934622443f9\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img692/7017/hh2support.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img703/6636/6kvo.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1721-beckett","name":"Beckett","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1077"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-26T05:25:26-07:00","id":1222213,"title":"","content":"got a pocket knife, a relatively fancy one in the mail from the NRA yesterday<br /> <br /> Joined it because all this recent hype forced me to take side's..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-26T06:03:27-07:00","id":1222222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1217700-recent-calls-for-gun-control-hows-it-effect-wod?p=1222213#post1222213\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">got a pocket knife, a relatively fancy one in the mail from the NRA yesterday<br /> <br /> Joined it because all this recent hype forced me to take side's..</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> As a gun enthusiast, I would've enjoyed the NRA decades ago when they were more of a hobbyist and safety group, as opposed to the giant, fear-mongering lobbyist group they've become. The ones at the top are a bunch of assholes, the ones in the middle at the major gun shows are dick deep in nazi propaganda, and the ones at the bottom are too stupid to know any better.<br /> <br /> I served in the Air Force for 4 years, so I know a lot of the ones in the middle and the bottom.<br /> <br /> However, I DO understand where you're coming from. Just sad that the NRA is a bit too much of a real life Pentex subsidiary for me to support them. <br /> <br /> I LOVE Pentex in my games, just not in real life. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Common sense gun laws are needed, and they're an obstacle to those laws. </span></span></span>Sorry for the rant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat La